{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07525","headline":"赠裴将军 · 颜真卿","name":"赠裴将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君制六合，猛将清九垓。\n战马若龙虎，腾凌何壮哉。\n将军临八荒，烜赫耀英材。\n劒舞若游电，随风萦且回。\n登高望天山，白云正崔巍。\n入阵破骄虏，威名雄震雷。\n一射百马倒，再射万夫开。\n匈奴不敢敌，相呼归去来。\n功成报天子，可以画麟台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}